## 12 Ready-to-Use Script Templates with Exact Timing

### 1. The Skeptical Creator Review
- **0:00 - 0:03 (Hook)**: Creator holds product directly to camera with eyebrow raised: *"I genuinely thought this was another TikTok scam, but look at this."*
- **0:04 - 0:10 (Demonstration)**: Cut immediately to high-speed action of product solving the problem effortlessly.
- **0:11 - 0:20 (Payoff)**: Show before/after result with authentic reaction: *"My jaw literally hit the floor."*
- **0:21 - 0:30 (CTA)**: *"They're running 30% off today—tap the link below before it sells out."*

### 2. The Stop Doing This Mistake
- **0:00 - 0:03 (Hook)**: Intense close-up of creator shaking head: *"Please stop doing this to your skin every single morning."*
- **0:04 - 0:12 (Problem)**: Pointing at screen showing irritation, dullness, or messy setup.
- **0:13 - 0:22 (Solution)**: Demonstrating the 1-step product application with satisfying sound.
- **0:23 - 0:30 (CTA)**: *"Grab yours on TikTok Shop while shipping is still free."*

### 3. The Unboxing ASMR Hook
- **0:00 - 0:03 (Hook)**: Crisp cutting sound of tape and satisfying box click directly into microphone. Zero spoken words, just high-fidelity audio.
- **0:04 - 0:15 (Reveal)**: Peel off protective film, showcase silky matte texture, turn on power with LED glow.
- **0:16 - 0:25 (Voiceover Entry)**: *"I finally caved and bought the viral [Product], and here is why..."*
- **0:26 - 0:30 (CTA)**: Clean branded title card with dynamic discount code.

