## How to Test Hooks at Scale with Motion Studio

The single biggest mistake performance marketers make is testing one video creative at a time. The winning methodology is **Hook Isolation Testing**:
1. Take **one core product video body** (the middle 20 seconds).
2. Use Motion Studio to generate **6 distinct 3-second hook variations** (Negative Warning, Visual Interrupt, Creator Skepticism, Identity Callout, ASMR, and Contrarian Hot Take).
3. Combine them into 6 video exports.
4. Launch them into a Meta Advantage+ Creative or TikTok CBO campaign with identical target audiences.
5. Identify the hook with the highest **3-Second Thumb-Stop Rate** and allocate 80% of budget to scale it.

